  aciklama:
  - "Onca sevgi ve fedakarl\u0131\u011Fa ra\u011Fmen \xE7i\xE7ekleri a\xE7mad\u0131\u011F\u0131
    i\xE7in, \"acaba g\xFCne\u015Fi mi sen de\u011Filsin?\" diye d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCrken,
    fincan\u0131n\u0131n kar\u015F\u0131 duvar\u0131nda ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    sevgilini g\xF6rd\xFCm. \U0001F644Y\xFCz\xFCn\xFC \xE7evirse de, kalbi hala sana
    d\xF6n\xFCk {{isim}}. \u015Eu an \xF6yle bir s\u0131n\u0131rda g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor
    ki, tek bir s\xF6z\xFCnle itsen, falezlerden a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 da u\xE7abilir,
    tek bir hamlenle \xE7eksen, a\u015Fk\u0131n\u0131z da kurtulabilir. \u015Eu noktada
    senin sava\u015F\u0131n, kendi gururunla. \U0001F928Ben bu \xE7eki\u015Fmeyi,
    y\xFCre\u011Finin kazanaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorum. Akl\u0131
    bazen devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131 b\u0131rakmak ve son tahlildeki marjinal faydaya
    bakmak gerek.\n\n\xD6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki {{sayi,4,10}} g\xFCn i\xE7erisinde, \xE7ok
    \xFCzg\xFCn oldu\u011Funa dair bir i\u015Faret g\xF6recek ya da bir duyum alacaks\u0131n.
    Iss\u0131z ve karanl\u0131k bir okyanusta g\xF6\u011Fe do\u011Fru y\xFCkselen
    bir havai fi\u015Fek varsa, orada durumundan memnun olmayan ve \xE7ekip \xE7\u0131kar\u0131lmak
    isteyen birileri de vard\u0131r. Fincan\u0131n, bar\u0131\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor {{isim}}. Fakat ya\u015Fananlar\u0131n \xFCzerine her ikinizin
    de s\xFCnger \xE7ekmesi \u015Fart."
